1286
01:24:40.000 --> 01:24:43.000
I make dangerous choices because
I have an unhealthy bunny hero complex.

1287
01:24:43.000 --> 01:24:46.000
And I didn't join the ZPD
because I wanted to be a cop.

1288
01:24:46.000 --> 01:24:49.000
